1. In the m2snes binary
-----------------------

1.1 M2RoS
    https://github.com/metroidret/M2RoS

    A labelled disassembly of Metroid II, used as the behavioural spec. No file
    of it is vendored or shipped. The m2snes engine images, which the binary
    embeds, follow it closely: engine/main.asm and engine/audio/main.asm port
    the game's routines using M2RoS's routine and variable names and its
    structure, and cite it by file and line (engine/audio/main.asm about 150
    times, engine/main.asm about 30). The embedded symbol file
    engine/engine.sym carries many of those names. src/offsets.zig, also
    compiled in, names ROM locations after M2RoS (131 citations), though each
    offset is verified against the ROM itself. Its notice is reproduced
    because of that derivation.

